id: DRAFT-parlay-0.11.0-go-test-exec-sign-column0-count
trigger_tool: go|conan|test
phase: testing
error_signature: go test -v -count=1.*returncode=1|discovered=72/executed=0|executed 83 vs discovered 72|cat.*\/tmp\/parlay-neg-.*No such file
severity: 3
category: ohos, testing, build-system, portability
match_keywords: go test -exec, ohos sign wrapper, column-0, readonly_tmp, hmbs_repair_method
title: OHOS下go test临时二进制-exec前自签名与column-0顶层诚实计数
root_cause: 主parlay二进制与Go SDK已自签名，但go test在GOTMPDIR生成的临时.test二进制未经签名被OHOS内核拒绝fork/exec致零--- PASS/FAIL行，旧逻辑又用skipped算术补齐掩盖；另conanfile用strip后判--- PASS把缩进t.Run子测试计入致83大于顶层72，且test.sh负例写死/tmp致重定向失败
affected_scope: 上游为Go模块且go test -v含t.Run子测试、需在OHOS真机执行GOTMPDIR临时测试二进制的Go库
verification_cmd: 真机保留go test -v -count=1 -exec wrapper的returncode与PASS/FAIL/SKIP顶层计数，executed/passed与grep ^func Test顶层数一致且无skipped算术补齐，并附80行日志tail
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: go-test-exec-sign-plus-column0-count
rec_description: 新增go-test-exec.sh在exec前对临时.test二进制自签名后执行，OHOS自动带-exec wrapper；仅计column-0顶层--- PASS/FAIL/SKIP行并删除skipped补齐如实计数加gaps，负例输出改用TMPDIR
rec_command: archives/p/parlay/0.11.0/conanfile.py: 新增_write_go_test_exec_wrapper并在OHOS时go test自动带-exec wrapper，_run_upstream_tests改line.startswith仅计column-0；archives/p/parlay/0.11.0/test_package/test.sh: 负例输出改${TMPDIR:-${TMP:-${TEMP:-/tmp}}}/parlay-neg-$$.out并mkdir -p
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: log-tail-audit-plus-manual-sign
fallback_description: 若-exec wrapper不可用则保留80行日志tail审计零执行，手动对GOTMPDIR下.test二进制补签名后重跑并坚持column-0单源计数
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: executed=0.*skipped=72|executed 83 vs discovered 72
forbid_1_reason: 禁止用skipped算术补齐把72个未观测用例伪装成跳过，或用strip后匹配把缩进子测试计入顶层掩盖零执行与多计
forbid_1_consequence: 真机rule4 inconsistent或evidence incomplete，任务退回修复循环且72口径无法对齐
